## Firebase data model suggestion
- **notes (collection)**: { title, description, pdfUrl }
- **videos (collection)**: { title, description, videoUrl }
- **quizzes (collection)**: doc per quiz -> subcollection **questions**: { question, options:[], correct }
- **results (collection)**: { userId, quizId, score, timestamp }

